{"suttaId":"thag4.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1425,1437],"vripara":"295"},"segments":{"thag4.8:0.4":"Rāhulattheragāthā","thag4.8:1.1":"“Ubhayeneva sampanno, rāhulabhaddoti maṃ vidū;","thag4.8:1.3":"Yañcamhi putto buddhassa, yañca dhammesu cakkhumā.","thag4.8:2.1":"“Yañca me āsavā khīṇā, yañca natthi punabbhavo;","thag4.8:2.3":"Arahā dakkhiṇeyyomhi, tevijjo amataddaso.","thag4.8:3.1":"“Kāmandhā jālapacchannā, taṇhāchādanachāditā;","thag4.8:3.3":"Pamattabandhunā baddhā, macchāva kumināmukhe.","thag4.8:4.1":"“Taṃ kāmaṃ ahamujjhitvā, chetvā mārassa bandhanaṃ;","thag4.8:4.3":"Samūlaṃ taṇhamabbuyha, sītibhūtosmi nibbuto”ti.","thag4.8:4.5":"… Rāhulo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
